<section id="faqs"><h2>Frequently asked: Financial Advisory in British Columbia</h2><h3>How does an advisor get LinkedIn distribution from IAM?</h3><p>Every TALC.TV financial-planning article auto-publishes to your LinkedIn as a long-form thought-leadership post with your bio, designations, and a calendar-booking CTA. LinkedIn is the dominant B2B and HNW prospecting channel in 2026.</p>
